{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["And further, it is written concerning it: מלבד עולת התמיד. Why is it not written with it: ומלבד שתי הלחם ופר ושני אילים ושני כבשים — those offered on that day — as is written in Rosh HaShanah: מלבד עולת החדש ומלבד עולת התמיד, and likewise on Yom HaKippurim: מלבד חטאת הכפורים ועולת התמיד? One may answer that they are all included in the general statement of what is written: וביום הבכורים בהקריבכם מנחה חדשה לה' בשבועותיכם — on account of the meal-offering all these come, and not as an additional offering."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:10:19.012448920Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}